  "title": "06/09/2026 – Precision Optics to Present at the Planet MicroCap Las Vegas 2026 Investor Conference on June 17, 2026",
  "summary": "LITTLETON, Mass., June 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. (Nasdaq: POCI) (the “Company”), a leading designer and manufacturer of advanced optical instruments for the medical and defense/aerospace industries, today announced that it will be presenting at the Planet MicroCap Las Vegas 2026 Investor Conference Powered by MicroCapClub on Wednesday, June 17, 2026, […]",
